    "updated_at": "2024-08-15T16:15:00Z",
    "body": "I assume bots would be made that specifically gather content that is marked as sensitive so that it can be more efficiently exploited.\r\n\r\nAs for telling AI not to consume data ... I would appreciate, if at least benevolent players would agree to respect a simple, general value such as `noai` (suggested by [DeviantArt](https://www.deviantart.com/team/journal/UPDATE-All-Deviations-Are-Opted-Out-of-AI-Datasets-934500371)) in the `<meta name='robots' content='...'>` tag and X-Robots-Tag HTTP header. Is there any hope for this to happen?",
