    "body": "It seems like this embedded signal should be coordinated with the page-wide and site-wide signals being contemplated after https://www.ietf.org/archive/id/draft-iab-ai-control-report-00.html.\n\nEdit: there's now an IETF working group chartered to develop these signals at https://datatracker.ietf.org/wg/aipref/about/.",
