    "updated_at": "2025-02-05T04:23:35Z",
    "body": "My understanding is similar to what @bokand listed above. This attribute gives the user agent a strong hint that user permission should be obtained before sharing the data externally, e.g. with AI service. This also aligns with the capture prevention use case discussed in https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/10519#issuecomment-2405502296.\n\n",
